+    "note": "Finite ranks; 0<epsilon<=10^-5. R=3m/(62N), B=mR^2/2, delta=R*sqrt(m/(2J)), m=min(a,N*epsilon)/2, J=max(a,25N). Declared Frobenius/unit-sphere orbit metric. 211 exact/interval checks, 64 cells, six synthetic jets. Conservative; endpoint and maximal basin open. No physical calibration; promotion 0.",
